{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19106280","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19106280","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910628001:1":{"text":"이 각인들이 마모된 정도가 좀 이상해. 어떤 시기에는 새겨진 글이 유난히 적어서 거의 텅 비어 있는데...","source_cn":"先生，我们发现这些刻痕的磨损程度有些奇怪，有些时期的刻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF49ABBC548A1BB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910628002:1":{"text":"아무도 소원을 기록하지 않은 시기를 말하는 거군요. 그건 저희가 겪어 온 자연의 이치입니다.","source_cn":"你是说那些无人记录心愿的年代，这是我们所经的自然规律。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A16E7EE8F59D207","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910628003:1":{"text":"潮水有涨落，记忆也有枯荣。有些时候就是没有心愿漂来，仅此而已。","source_cn":"潮水有涨落，记忆也有枯荣。有些时候就是没有心愿漂来，仅...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x423ACCA5C9D762DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1910628003":{"text":"潮水有涨落，记忆也有枯荣。有些时候就是没有心愿漂来，仅此而已。","source_cn":"潮水有涨落，记忆也有枯荣。有些时候就是没有心愿漂来，仅此而已。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x423ACCA5C9D762DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910628004:1":{"text":"二百年，三百年，抑或更久。领航者家族最先发现了这座潮池，他们到时，已经有心愿刻在岩石的鳞片上。","source_cn":"二百年，三百年，抑或更久。领航者家族最先发现了这座潮池...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xCBF130C6D44581DC","variant_status":"","male":"","femal